        "text": "Every year, Binance celebrates Bitcoin Pizza Day. It's the anniversary of when programmer Laszlo Hanyets purchased two large pizzas for 10,000 bitcoins back in 2010, a moment that has become a legendary milestone in the crypto world. From Paris to Dubai, Taiwan to Johannesburg, we set out to make this day special, showcasing the incredible growth and global reach of cryptocurrency. And of course, nothing brings people together like free pizza. But today isn't just about pizza, about connecting people together, fostering a sense of community, and celebrating the spirit of crypto.",
